cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use PubChroma or FigureLint-Bio in published work, please cite
  using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "PubChroma + FigureLint-Bio: journal-inspired colour recommendation and figure QA"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2025-04-05"
license: MIT
url: https://github.com/tyuan2024/pubchroma
repository-code: https://github.com/tyuan2024/pubchroma
abstract: >
  PubChroma provides field-aware and figure-aware colour palette recommendations
  for biomedical and engineering visualizations. FigureLint-Bio is a pre-submission
  figure quality-assurance tool that lints structured figure specifications against
  palette, accessibility, typography, and export rules.
authors:
  - family-names: "Yuan"
    given-names: "Tian"
    alias: tyuan2024
keywords:
  - color palette
  - scientific visualization
  - biomedical figures
  - figure quality assurance
  - accessibility
  - colorblind safety
  - publication figures
